<title>UK: United News buys PR News Serice of Chicago.</title>
<headline>United News buys PR News Serice of Chicago.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's United News &amp; Media Plc said on Tuesday that it has acquired PR News Service of Chicago.</p>
<p>It did not disclose the acquisition price.</p>
</text>
